1
00:00:45,916 --> 00:00:47,708
Sudah siap,

2
00:00:47,708 --> 00:00:48,833
Nanook?

3
00:00:49,708 --> 00:00:52,500
Aku sudah membawa kehancuran untukmu!

4
00:01:09,833 --> 00:01:13,000
Aku merasakan rasa sakit dan amarah, monster jahat ini, lepas kendali\nI feel the pain and anger, wicked monster, losin' control

5
00:01:13,125 --> 00:01:16,291
Siap untuk bertempur, bayangan gelap terbangun, darah membasuh jiwaku\nI'm ready for a battle, wakened shadow, blood on my soul

6
00:01:16,416 --> 00:01:17,875
Bakar, bakar semuanya\nBurn it, burning it all

7
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,583
Surga, biarkan runtuh\nHeavens, let them fall

8
00:01:22,791 --> 00:01:26,000
Pahit seperti abu, sampah plastik berserak, segalanya runtuh, tak tersisa\nThey taste of bitter ashes, littered plastic, crumblin' away

9
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,291
Melihat wajah yang hancur, iblis berpacu, mencari keyakinan\nThey glimpse the broken faces, devil racin', searching for faith

10
00:01:29,375 --> 00:01:30,875
Hancurkan, hancurkan semuanya\nCrushing, crushing it all

11
00:01:30,875 --> 00:01:34,291
Bayangan, saksikan ia merangkak\nShadows, watch them crawl

12
00:01:36,125 --> 00:01:39,166
Merayap masuk ke dalam pikiranku\nCreepin' up my brain

13
00:01:39,166 --> 00:01:44,875
Belajar dari rasa sakitku\nLearnin' from my pain

14
00:01:46,166 --> 00:01:49,666
Sayang, lihatlah ia terbakar, kirimkan kematian pada kesendirian\nBaby watchin' it burn, send death to isolation

15
00:01:49,666 --> 00:01:52,958
Oh lihatlah ia terbakar, tanpa ragu menanti\nOh watchin' it burn, ain't got no hesitation

16
00:01:53,583 --> 00:01:56,125
Lihatlah ia terbakar, kita jatuh semakin tinggi\nWatchin' it burn, we're fallin' higher

17
00:01:59,666 --> 00:02:02,666
Lihatlah ia terbakar!\nWatchin' it burn!

18
00:02:02,666 --> 00:02:05,250
Oh lihatlah ia terbakar!\nOh watchin' it burn!

19
00:02:06,041 --> 00:02:08,833
Lihatlah ia terbakar!\nWatchin' it burn!

20
00:02:09,416 --> 00:02:12,708
Lihatlah ia terbakar!\nWatchin' it burn!

21
00:02:26,916 --> 00:02:30,750
Laksana pecahan kaca, menembus kegelapan\nLike glass that shattered, reaching through the darkness

22
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:34,541
Suara-suara membuntuti api, gema dari hasrat yang membara\nVoices trailing fires, echo of desires

23
00:02:34,541 --> 00:02:38,375
Di dunia yang sunyi, melodi Kematian berarak\nA world of silence, sound of Death's parading

24
00:02:38,375 --> 00:02:44,958
Bayangan di balik gelap, diam-diam menunggu\nPhantoms in the shadow, softly waiting...

25
00:02:47,541 --> 00:02:50,833
'Kan kuhancurkan! Rangkullah ledakan ini\nI'm tearin' it down! Embrace the detonation

26
00:02:50,833 --> 00:02:54,125
Bakar sebesar mungkin! Inilah ciptaan terkutuk kita\nBurnin' it loud! Cravin' our damn creation

27
00:02:54,708 --> 00:02:57,375
Putuskan rantai! 'Kan kuraih dirimu\nBreakin' the chain! I'm reachin' for ya

28
00:03:00,916 --> 00:03:03,833
Berserulah hingga akhir! Api ini penebusanku!\nShout till the end! This blaze is my salvation!

29
00:03:03,833 --> 00:03:07,166
Pedang di tengah angin! Aku menghantam tanpa penyesalan!\nSword in the wind! I strike without damnation!

30
00:03:07,791 --> 00:03:09,458
Hancurkan langit\nShatter the skies!

31
00:03:09,458 --> 00:03:10,666
Tiada takdir\nNo fate

32
00:03:10,666 --> 00:03:11,791
Tiada raja\nNo king

33
00:03:11,791 --> 00:03:13,916
Tiada dewa!\nNo god!

34
00:03:13,916 --> 00:03:16,375
Tunduklah pada keagunganku!\nFall to my name!

35
00:03:17,041 --> 00:03:19,500
Tunduklah pada keagunganku!\nFall to my name!

36
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:22,958
Tunduklah pada keagunganku!\nFall to my name!

37
00:03:23,666 --> 00:03:30,833
Tunduklah pada keagunganku!\nFall to my name!

38
00:04:15,041 --> 00:04:16,125
Harapanku?

39
00:04:18,041 --> 00:04:19,125
Aku berharap ...

40
00:04:19,125 --> 00:04:20,833
untuk mewujudkan harapan semua orang.

41
00:04:25,166 --> 00:04:27,333
Kalau aku tidak mampu ...

42
00:04:28,625 --> 00:04:31,125
Maka kirimkan mereka ke hari esok.

